    id 238
    label "ZvzzMFgy6mw"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-16T10:00:23Z"
    title "The Greatbridge s Play [Ep.5]"
    description "Empires SMP Season 2 continues! &#10;Empires SMP is a Minecraft 1.19 multiplayer server with a small group of incredible content creators. In this episode we embark on one of my biggest builds ever - an ancient bridge spanning the lake near Spawn! But before we can do that, we need to mine a LOT of stone, visit an Ancient City to grab a Swift Sneak enchantment, and do a quick Froglight trade with Scott Smajor.&#10;Once the Greatbridge is finished, I unpack all the details of the build, unpack all my shulker boxes, and go sneak a detail into someone else's base which they'll hopefully thank me for later.&#10;&#10;Throughout this series I'll be collaborating, trading, scheming and fighting with a bunch of awesome creators! You can find their channels below:&#10;&#10;FalseSymmetry: https://www.youtube.com/falsesymmetry&#10;fWhip: https://www.youtube.com/fwhip&#10;GeminiTay: https://www.youtube.com/GeminiTayMC&#10;Joey: https://www.youtube.com/joeygraceffagames&#10;Katherine Elizabeth: https://www.youtube.com/katherineelizabethgaming&#10;LDShadowlady: https://www.youtube.com/ldshadowlady&#10;MythicalSausage: https://www.youtube.com/TheMythicalSausage&#10;Pixlriffs: https://www.youtube.com/Pixlriffs&#10;Shubble: https://www.youtube.com/c/shubble&#10;Smajor1995: https://www.youtube.com/dangthatsalongname&#10;Smallishbeans: https://www.youtube.com/smallishbeans&#10;Solidarity: https://www.youtube.com/user/SolidarityGaming&#10;&#10;Time lapse recorded and rendered using the Replay Mod: https://replaymod.com/&#10;Shaders used: Complementary Shaders https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/complementary-shaders&#10;&#10;Music used: &#10;Minecraft OST by C418, Lena Raine&#10;Miyolophone - &#34;Mandragora&#34; &#38; Faux Tales - &#34;Beacon&#34; &#10;With thanks to Mandragora, Faux Tales, &#38; The Arcadium: https://youtube.com/thearcadium&#10;&#10;Follow the Empires SMP Season 2 playlist here:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlt__jM620o&#38;list=PLgENJ0iY3XBhAx6RhGFYqsyzFDg-a6_3e&#10;----&#10;&#10;Watch my streams live every Tuesday, Thursday, and Sunday around 3pm BST! http://twitch.tv/pixlriffs&#10;Follow Pix on Twitter for video updates, screenshots, and other fun stuff! http://www.twitter.com/pixlriffs&#10;&#10;GNU Paranor001&#10;&#10;#Minecraft #Survival #Multiplayer #Empires #SMP"
